<title>UK: Euromarket turnover rose in week to Feb 20 - ISMA.</title>
<headline>Euromarket turnover rose in week to Feb 20 - ISMA.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Turnover in Eurobond and related markets rose to $1.004 trillion in the week to February 20 from $990.2 billion the previous week, International Securities Market Association data showed (in billions of dollars):</p>
<p>					  Latest week	Previous week</p>
<p> Primary market:		     63.90		57.84</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues     32.45		28.60</p>
<p> Secondary market:		  982.28	     932.40</p>
<p> Of which U.S. dollar issues    209.08	     232.43</p>
<p> Cleared through Euroclear	764.13	     729.56</p>
<p> Cleared through Cedel	    282.05	     260.68</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
